==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Ferrothorn|103}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion; both cards have the Guard Press attack.
*'''Guard Press''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unleashed|Steelix|24}} from the {{TCG|Unleashed}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

